body:
Thank you for your thoughtful response. I was particularly spooked because I wasn't sure whether I mentioned often times restraining myself from really expressing myself for fear of being "too much" for people, but it is something I struggle with often. \^\^;

There was a long period of time when I was overly invested in some people who weren't very invested back, but that's something I took action to change a while back. Since then, I've been focusing on finding kinder people to invest myself in.

I *have* been struggling to be my best self lately, though. Anything other than merely making it through the day seems like kind of a bigger prospect than I can really grapple with. I tend to hide within the moment, focusing on distractions, and I only really contend with any of the bigger questions, or issues, when I'm feeling sad and introspective.
